    "latency-scorer.tpotWeight = 0.9 \u2014 1 - ttftWeight (0.1) = 0.9",
    "prefix-cache-scorer.autoTune = True \u2014 plugin default. Reads vllm:cache_config_info per-pod to size LRUCapacityPerServer (num_gpu_blocks) and BlockSizeTokens (block_size). Verify the model server exports the metric.",
    "prefix-cache-scorer.maxPrefixTokensToMatch = 131072 \u2014 set to model_context_length=131072. Plugin divides by autoTuned block_size at request time."
